---
---
<main class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Taskflow</h1>
    <p class="slogan">Seu time. Uma visão. Zero caos.</p>
    <p class="desc">Taskflow centraliza projetos, prazos e comunicação do seu time em um único lugar, para que nada se perca.</p>
    <a href="#features" class="cta">Experimente grátis</a>
  </div>
</main>

<style>
.hero {
  background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--color-primary) 60%, var(--color-secondary) 100%);
  color: var(--color-light);
  padding: 6rem 0 4rem 0;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  min-height: 60vh;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
}
.hero .container {
  max-width: 700px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  text-align: center;
}
.hero h1 {
  font-size: 3rem;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
  letter-spacing: -2px;
  font-weight: 800;
}
.slogan {
  font-size: 1.5rem;
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  font-weight: 500;
}
.desc {
  font-size: 1.15rem;
  margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  color: var(--color-light);
  opacity: 0.95;
}
.cta {
  display: inline-block;
  background: var(--color-light);
  color: var(--color-primary);
  font-weight: 700;
  padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 16px 0 rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.10);
  transition: background 0.2s, color 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
}
.cta:hover {
  background: var(--color-secondary);
  color: var(--color-light);
  transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.04);
}
</style>
